        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-07-19T11:10:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Surely it's the latter (score is based on the current cost). Reading the rules, that seemed like a key strategic part of the game. There's no way to keep track of the first option.</p>",
